## This project uses the JavaScript version of PDG (Pixel Dust Game engine) for rendering and control
- see https://github.com/ezavada/pdg/tree/v1.0.0/docs/javascript for the public PDG API documentation
- see ../galactica-4/src/js/ for an example of a well implemented simple PDG application
- see https://github.com/ezavada/pdg/tree/v1.0.0/test for tested graphics and general examples
- to run the app, use `./skrybble`
